    "text": "$\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\frac{(\\sin x+\\cos x)^2}{\\sqrt{(\\sin x+\\cos x)^2}} d x=\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}(\\sin x+\\cos x) d x=|-\\cos x+\\sin x|_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}=2$",
